{"seq":81,"slug":"property-based-testing","title":"属性测试与模糊测试","stage":"DONE","category":"languages","chapterCount":4,"docCount":12,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/property-based-testing","rating":{"composite":4.18,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":4,"coverage":4,"positioning":4.5,"strategic":4.33},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":null},"introMarkdown":"# 属性测试与模糊测试\n\n属性测试（Property-Based Testing）与模糊测试（Fuzzing）代表了一种根本性的测试思维转变：从\"验证我想到的场景\"转向\"自动探索我没想到的边界\"。传统的举例式测试（example-based testing）要求开发者手工构造输入和预期输出，其覆盖范围受限于人的想象力；而属性测试要求开发者定义\"对所有合法输入都必须成立的不变量\"，由框架自动生成海量输入来尝试反驳这些属性。模糊测试则更进一步——它甚至不需要显式的属性定义，只需一个\"不崩溃\"的最低预期，通过覆盖率引导的变异策略深入程序内部路径，发现传统测试无法触达的安全漏洞与边界错误。\n\n本 hub 的定位与相邻知识域形成互补分工：\n\n- **与类型系统（type-systems）的分工**：类型系统在编译期提供静态保证——通过类型约束排除一整类非法状态；属性测试则在运行期对类型系统无法覆盖的*语义不变量*进行动态验证。两者构成静态+动态的双层防线。\n- **与端到端测试自动化（e2e-test-automation）的分工**：端到端测试验证系统各组件的集成行为，关注\"用户流程是否正确走通\"；属性测试与模糊测试关注单个函数或模块的*行为边界*，在更底层发现隐藏的逻辑缺陷。\n\n本 hub 从四个维度展开：**基础理论**建立属性测试的核心概念框架（生成器、收缩器、属性模式）；**模糊测试**深入覆盖率引导与结构化模糊的工程实践；**变异测试**介绍如何度量测试套件本身的有效性；**工程实践**将上述技术落地到状态机测试、CI 集成和多语言生态。\n\n这一技术栈的核心价值在于：它能系统性地发现人类测试直觉的盲区——空字符串、极大整数、Unicode 特殊字符、格式边界附近的畸形输入——这些恰恰是生产环境崩溃的元凶。2000 年 Claessen 和 Hughes 的 QuickCheck 论文开创了属性测试范式，此后 Hypothesis（Python）、fast-check（TypeScript）、Go 1.18 原生 fuzzing、AFL/LibFuzzer 等工具将这一理念推广到了主流工程实践。\n\n延伸阅读：类型系统如何在编译期提供静态保证，见 type-systems hub；功能验证层面的自动化测试编排，见 e2e-test-automation hub。\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"foundations","title":"属性测试基础","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/property-based-testing/foundations","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"pbt-principles","title":"属性测试的核心原理","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/property-based-testing/foundations/pbt-principles"},{"seq":2,"slug":"generators-shrinking","title":"生成器与收缩器机制","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/property-based-testing/foundations/generators-shrinking"},{"seq":3,"slug":"property-patterns","title":"属性模式与不变量","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/property-based-testing/foundations/property-patterns"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"fuzzing","title":"模糊测试技术","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/property-based-testing/fuzzing","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"fuzzing-fundamentals","title":"模糊测试基础原理","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/property-based-testing/fuzzing/fuzzing-fundamentals"},{"seq":2,"slug":"coverage-guided-fuzzing","title":"覆盖率引导模糊测试","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/property-based-testing/fuzzing/coverage-guided-fuzzing"},{"seq":3,"slug":"structured-fuzzing","title":"结构化模糊测试","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/property-based-testing/fuzzing/structured-fuzzing"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"mutation","title":"变异测试","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/property-based-testing/mutation","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"mutation-testing-principles","title":"变异测试的核心原理","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/property-based-testing/mutation/mutation-testing-principles"},{"seq":2,"slug":"mutation-tools","title":"变异测试工具","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/property-based-testing/mutation/mutation-tools"},{"seq":3,"slug":"mutation-metrics","title":"变异测试指标与改进策略","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/property-based-testing/mutation/mutation-metrics"}]},{"seq":4,"slug":"practice","title":"工程实践","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/property-based-testing/practice","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"stateful-testing","title":"状态机测试","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/property-based-testing/practice/stateful-testing"},{"seq":2,"slug":"integration-ci","title":"CI 集成与持续模糊","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/property-based-testing/practice/integration-ci"},{"seq":3,"slug":"language-ecosystem","title":"语言生态系统纵览","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/property-based-testing/practice/language-ecosystem"}]}]}